  "npcs": [
    {
      "id": "ruin_maniac",
      "name": "Ruin Maniac",
      "npcType": "Gentleman",
      "x": 4,
      "y": 9,
      "facing": "Up",
      "dialog": [
        "I look, and I see my father. My son. My own life.",
        "I look, and I see nature. Pokémon. The world."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "old_man",
      "name": "Old Man",
      "npcType": "Gentleman",
      "x": 13,
      "y": 9,
      "facing": "Left",
      "dialog": [
        "Making things wears out the spirit.",
        "The spirit mends, and the wish to make something comes back. What a wondrous circle it is."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ninja_boy",
      "name": "Boy",
      "npcType": "Youngster",
      "x": 2,
      "y": 14,
      "facing": "Left",
      "dialog": [
        "When people and Pokémon join hands, everybody's happy!",
        "It brings everyone together. It could make the whole world one!"
      ],
      "movement": "wander_north_and_south",
      "rangeZ": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "old_woman",
      "name": "Old Woman",
      "npcType": "Lady",
      "x": 5,
      "y": 12,
      "facing": "Up",
      "dialog": [
        "It is only natural to be lonely. Being lonely is what teaches me to feel for others.",
        "It is why I look forward to a better tomorrow.",
        "And still, now and then, I am fond of days gone by. Time does mend some sorrows, though..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ace_trainer_f",
      "name": "Ace Trainer",
      "npcType": "Lass",
      "x": 6,
      "y": 15,
      "facing": "Up",
      "dialog": [
        "There are words that not everyone can explain...",
        "\"Love\", for one. And \"joy\"."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pokefan_f",
      "name": "Pokéfan",
      "npcType": "Lady",
      "x": 11,
      "y": 18,
      "facing": "Up",
      "dialog": [
        "Pokémon, people... of course we are all different. How could we not be?",
        "Never judge a Pokémon by whether it is weak or strong.",
        "Look for the good in it, always. That is what counts!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lady",
      "name": "Lady",
      "npcType": "lady",
      "x": 8,
      "y": 8,
      "facing": "Up",
      "dialog": [
        "Mind and matter.",
        "Neither must be stronger than the other. Balance. That is the key."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "psychic",
      "name": "Psychic",
      "npcType": "Youngster",
      "x": 2,
      "y": 19,
      "facing": "Right",
      "dialog": [
        "We cannot read each other's minds, and so we fear and we doubt.",
        "But to rule what lies beyond our senses is more than anyone can do."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "expert_m",
      "name": "Old Man",
      "npcType": "Gentleman",
      "x": 15,
      "y": 10,
      "facing": "Left",
      "dialog": [
        "When the strong and able do too much, they leave no room for what others could give.",
        "The strong must hold back. That is how everyone lives together, each with a share to carry."
      ]
    }
  ],
